# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# PVS-036: while a drag hovers where the drop would COPY, the pointer
# picture wears a plus badge -- the copy cursor's spelling here.  Option
# forces a copy, so the badge follows the modifier live.
wait 10
press-row 1
move 90 160
move 90 198
wait 2
note a plain drag over its own folder is a move: no badge
expect-pixel 103 211 ffffff
note Option makes the same drop a copy, and the badge says so
move 90 198 1 alt
wait 2
expect-pixel 103 211 ffffbe
note the plus itself, black across the badge's middle
expect-pixel 106 214 000000
note letting Option go takes the badge away again -- what is left at the
note probe is the ghost picture's own tinted pixel, not the badge fill
move 90 198
wait 2
expect-pixel 103 211 b9cadb
release 90 198
quit
